{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f00dexpr-e551-4c0d-9a11-000000000001",
    "name": "FoodExpress API",
    "description": "Test collection for the FoodExpress backend (matches food-delivery-architecture-design.md).\n\n**How to use:**\n1. Import this collection AND the companion environment file, then select the environment (top-right dropdown in Postman).\n2. Run requests roughly top-to-bottom within a folder — later requests reuse IDs saved automatically by earlier ones (jwtToken, userId, restaurantId, menuItemId, orderId) via each request's Tests script.\n3. Typical happy path: Auth (register/login) → Restaurants (create + add menu item) → Orders (create + advance status) → Delivery.\n\nBase URL and the JWT are environment variables (`{{baseUrl}}`, `{{jwtToken}}`) — see the environment file, not hardcoded here.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{jwtToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('API is up', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Run one of the two Register requests first (or Login if you already have an account). Every request here saves jwtToken automatically — nothing to copy/paste by hand.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register - Customer",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Test Customer\",\n  \"email\": \"customer1@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('jwtToken', data.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log('jwtToken saved');",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Registered (201) or already exists (409)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201, 409]);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Register - Restaurant Owner",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Demo Restaurant Owner\",\n  \"email\": \"owner1@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"role\": \"restaurant_owner\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('jwtToken', data.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log('jwtToken saved (owner account)');",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Registered (201) or already exists (409)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201, 409]);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Register - Rider",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Demo Rider\",\n  \"email\": \"rider1@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"role\": \"rider\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('jwtToken', data.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log('jwtToken saved (rider account)');",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Registered (201) or already exists (409)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201, 409]);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"owner1@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('jwtToken', data.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log('jwtToken saved');",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Login succeeded', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Profile (auth/me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.userId) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('userId', data.userId);",
                  "    console.log('userId saved: ' + data.userId);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Profile returned', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Restaurants",
      "description": "Create Restaurant needs {{userId}} — run Auth > Get My Profile first, ideally while logged in as the restaurant-owner account.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Restaurants",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/restaurants",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["restaurants"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Restaurant",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ownerId\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"name\": \"Test Kitchen\",\n  \"description\": \"Created from Postman\",\n  \"cityId\": \"{{cityId}}\",\n  \"address\": \"MG Road, Bengaluru\",\n  \"latitude\": 12.9758,\n  \"longitude\": 77.6045\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/restaurants",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["restaurants"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.id) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('restaurantId', data.id);",
                  "    console.log('restaurantId saved: ' + data.id);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Restaurant created', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Restaurant by ID",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["restaurants", "{{restaurantId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Restaurant Menu",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/menu",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["restaurants", "{{restaurantId}}", "menu"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Menu Item",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Filter Coffee\",\n  \"description\": \"South Indian filter coffee\",\n  \"category\": \"Beverage\",\n  \"price\": 40\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/menu-items",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["restaurants", "{{restaurantId}}", "menu-items"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.id) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('menuItemId', data.id);",
                  "    console.log('menuItemId saved: ' + data.id);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Menu item created', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Menu Item",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"price\": 45,\n  \"isAvailable\": true\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/menu-items/{{menuItemId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["restaurants", "{{restaurantId}}", "menu-items", "{{menuItemId}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orders",
      "description": "Create Order needs {{restaurantId}} and {{menuItemId}} from the Restaurants folder. Run the status updates in order — the state machine rejects out-of-sequence transitions (e.g. jumping straight to 'ready'). Rate Order only works once status is 'delivered', only for the customer who placed it, and only once (a second attempt returns 409).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Order",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"restaurantId\": \"{{restaurantId}}\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"menuItemId\": \"{{menuItemId}}\",\n      \"quantity\": 2,\n      \"unitPrice\": 45\n    }\n  ],\n  \"deliveryAddress\": \"221B, 5th Cross, Bengaluru\",\n  \"deliveryLat\": 12.9352,\n  \"deliveryLng\": 77.6245\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["orders"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.id) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('orderId', data.id);",
                  "    console.log('orderId saved: ' + data.id);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Order created', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Order by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Orders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "me", "orders"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Status - Accepted",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"accepted\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}", "status"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Status - Preparing",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"preparing\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}", "status"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Status - Ready",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"ready\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}", "status"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Status - Picked Up",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"picked_up\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}", "status"]
            }
          },
          "description": "Advances the order's own status field. This is separate from Delivery > Mark Picked Up, which stamps the delivery assignment's own pickedUpAt timestamp — the two aren't currently linked."
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Status - Delivered",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"delivered\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}", "status"]
            }
          },
          "description": "Required before Rate Order will work — rating checks that the order's status is exactly 'delivered'."
        },
        {
          "name": "Rate Order",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"restaurantRating\": 5,\n  \"riderRating\": 4,\n  \"comment\": \"Great food, fast delivery\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/rating",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "{{orderId}}", "rating"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Rated (201), already rated (409), or not delivered yet (400)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201, 400, 403, 409]);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery",
      "description": "Flow: log in as a rider account (Auth > Register - Rider, or Login) → Register as Rider → Go Online → now Get Available Riders / Assign will actually have something to work with.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register as Rider",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"vehicleType\": \"bike\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/delivery/riders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["delivery", "riders"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.id) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('riderId', data.id);",
                  "    console.log('riderId saved: ' + data.id);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Registered (201) or already a rider (409)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201, 409]);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "description": "Uses the currently logged-in account ({{jwtToken}}) as the rider — make sure that's the rider account, not the customer/owner one, before running this."
        },
        {
          "name": "Go Online",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"isActive\": true\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/delivery/riders/me/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["delivery", "riders", "me", "status"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Go Offline",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"isActive\": false\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/delivery/riders/me/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["delivery", "riders", "me", "status"]
            }
          },
          "description": "Run this and re-run Get Available Riders below to see the rider disappear from the list."
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Available Riders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/delivery/riders/available",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["delivery", "riders", "available"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Assign Rider to Order",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"riderId\": \"{{riderId}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/delivery/assign",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["delivery", "assign"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mark Picked Up",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/delivery/{{orderId}}/picked-up",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["delivery", "{{orderId}}", "picked-up"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mark Delivered",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/delivery/{{orderId}}/delivered",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["delivery", "{{orderId}}", "delivered"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Payments",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Payment Webhook (stub)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"payment_intent.succeeded\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"orderId\": \"{{orderId}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payments/webhook",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments", "webhook"]
            }
          },
          "description": "This just hits the stub handler (always returns { received: true }) — real signature verification and status updates plug in once a payment provider is chosen."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}